        "biography": "",
        "appearance": "",
        "notes": "<h5>Tactics</h5><p>In combat, a <strong>commoner</strong> generally flees and seeks safety unless their loved ones are in immediate danger. When forced to fight, a commoner usually resorts to an Improvised Weapon; alternatively, they might Distract to aid a more capable ally. In conversations, commoners usually concede to those they consider more competent.</p>",
        "role": "minion"
    },
